problem:
Determine the radius of convergence of the power series \( \sum_{n=0}^\infty a_n x^n \), where the coefficients \( a_n \) are defined by the recurrence relation:
\[
\begin{aligned}
a_{n+2} &= \frac{n(n+1) a_{n+1} - a_n}{(n+2)(n+1)}, \quad n \ge 1, \\
a_2 &= -\frac{a_0}{2}
\end{aligned}
\]
with arbitrary initial values \( a_0 \) and \( a_1 \).
